WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Admin → Users and choose Create user or the pencil beside an account.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Set its username, permitted role, accessible locations and default location.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.125
Step 3: Enter a phone number for clock/kiosk PIN access. Its last four digits must be unique across the network.

4
00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:25.333
Step 4: Set a new password only when needed, or use the available account setup invitation workflow.

5
00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:31.333
Step 5: Save and tell affected users to sign in again after access or credential changes.
